      "min": 2,
      "body": "<p class=\"answer\"><b>A Client outside the system sends requests to the Gatekeeper; the Gatekeeper hands checked requests to the Bridge, which queues them for Downstream, further away and faded.</b></p>{{diagrams}}<div class=\"scroll\"><table><tr><th>Component</th><th>Kind</th><th>Responsible for</th></tr><tr><td><b>Gatekeeper</b></td><td>a class in the service process</td><td>{{L}} running {{part:intake}}, {{part:check}}, {{part:reply}}</td></tr></table></div>",
